duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Jj3UKjMufaPSwYYm","heightenedLevel":4},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756869456,"modifiedTime":1688756869456,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.piMJO6aYeDJbrhEo","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"Apf4DLl82bfk94oe"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/stinking-cloud.webp","name":"Stinking Cloud","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create a cloud of putrid mist in the area. The cloud functions as <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.9XHmC2JgTUIQ1CCm]{Obscuring Mist}</em> except it sickens creatures that end their turns within the cloud. (The @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.DmAIPqOBomZ7H95W]{Concealed} condition is not a poison effect.)</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} while in the cloud.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} until it leaves the cloud.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"stinking-cloud","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","poison"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":3},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":20},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Jj3UKjMufaPSwYYm","heightenedLevel":3},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756875574,"modifiedTime":1688756875574,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.GKpEcy9WId6NJvtx","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"OH5AZbvxzn31yDZc"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/entangle.webp","name":"Entangle","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Area</strong> all squares in a 20-foot burst that contain plants or fungi</p>\n<p>Plants and fungi entangle creatures. The area is difficult terrain. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a -10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.eIcWbB5o3pP6OIMe]{Immobilized} for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.SkZAQRkLLkmBQNB9]{Escape} at <em>entangle</em>'s DC to remove these effects.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.rjM25qfw5BKj9h97]{Spell Effect: Entangle}</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"entangle","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","plant"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"details":"all squares in a 20-foot-radius burst that contain plants","type":"burst","value":20},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"1 minute","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":false}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Jj3UKjMufaPSwYYm","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756880498,"modifiedTime":1688756880498,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.J6vNvrUT3b1hx2iA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"ktFPMBdWqJz95CUR"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/sudden-blight.webp","name":"Sudden Blight","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You accelerate the processes of decay in the area. Each living creature in the area takes [[/r 2d10[void]]] damage (basic Fortitude save). A creature afflicted by a disease takes a -2 circumstance penalty to this save.You can also direct the blight to rot all Small and Tiny non-creature plants in the area, eliminating non-magical undergrowth and any resulting difficult terrain, cover, and concealment. <em>Sudden blight</em> attempts to counteract any magical effect on the plants before withering them.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d10.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"sudden-blight","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["concentrate","manipulate","void"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["divine","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Advanced Player's Guide","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":2},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":{"type":"burst","value":20},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"formula":"2d10","type":"void","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"fortitude","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Jj3UKjMufaPSwYYm","heightenedLevel":2},"counteraction":true,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756886085,"modifiedTime":1688756886085,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.XFtO4BBI22Uox2QP","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"RGDlp2CA6mamYyJ0"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dancing-lights.webp","name":"Dancing Lights","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create up to four floating lights, no two of which are more than 10 feet apart. Each sheds light like a torch. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move any number of lights up to 60 feet. Each light must remain within 120 feet of you and within 10 feet of all others, or it winks out.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dancing-lights","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"Jj3UKjMufaPSwYYm"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756891706,"modifiedTime":1688756891706,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kl2q6JvBZwed4B6v","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"DdW5bPvgMhs5LDhh"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Illuminate","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The salirus hasn't used Obfuscate this turn</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The salirus fills a square within 60 feet with its swarm of fireflies. Any @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Invisible]{Invisible} creatures in the square or that have a portion of themselves in the square become @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Concealed]{Concealed} rather than undetected, as the fireflies settle on them. The fireflies remain in the square until the salirus moves them again by using either Illuminate or Obfuscate. Any creatures that move out of the square regain their invisibility. Whether there are any creatures in the square the salirus selects or not, the fireflies shine bright light in a 10-foot radius.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"Y0flENEQytoIWsSC","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756908377,"modifiedTime":1688756938416,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Obfuscate","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The salirus hasn't used Illuminate this turn</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The salirus surrounds itself with its swarm of fireflies, hiding from view. It is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Concealed]{Concealed} until the beginning of its next turn. It can't use this concealment to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.XMcnh4cSI32tljXa]{Hide} or @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.Sneak]{Sneak}, as normal for concealment that makes its position obvious.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"F2QOhKdHK0FohoMX","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756909366,"modifiedTime":1688756977127,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Target","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The salirus sends a single firefly to land on a creature to improve its aim. The salirus gains a +2 circumstance bonus to its attack roll on the next bow Strike against the creature made before the end of its turn. If the Strike hits it deals an additional 1d8 precision damage.</p>"},"rules":[{"domain":"all","key":"RollOption","option":"targeting","toggleable":true,"value":false},{"key":"FlatModifier","selector":"composite-longbow-attack","value":2,"type":"circumstance","predicate":["targeting"]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"composite-longbow-damage","diceNumber":1,"dieSize":"d8","category":"precision","predicate":["targeting"]}],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["light"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"NAN3SfU3pV2neZlT","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756909981,"modifiedTime":1688757153189,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Water Stride","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The salirus can stand and move on the surface of water or other liquids without falling through. It can go underwater whenever it wishes, but in that case, it must Swim until it returns to the surface.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"BiHmn7uUAIYkp2W1","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1688756911902,"m